## scroll test: waves slide in from the left, scroll a few times, then slide out.
## direction=right + blanking=true gives a blank lead-in (slide in from the left)
## and the linear pass ends on blanks (slide out), so it loops cleanly.
import|waves
scale|0.12
#loop|forever

scroll|anon|3|wave_profile|direction=right|blanking=true
